Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Topic tabs: the topic I sent to most recently sits on the
 left

Records the time of my last send per forum topic and orders the tabs by it, right after All and
any pinned topics. Topics I never wrote to keep the server order after them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
